DESCRIPTION:Join us for a dynamic one-day course designed to provide an overview of ISO New England and its role in grid operations\, market administration\, and power system planning.  This course is open to anyone in the power industry seeking to enhance their understanding of ISO New England's role and operations.\n\nRegister Now!\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160373
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160373
END:VEVENT
