BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165266@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260925T112655Z
DTSTART:20260915T172000Z
SUMMARY:On Tuesday\, September 15\, 2026\, power system conditions allowing\, ISO New England will update the EMS/Market power system model. 
DESCRIPTION:On Tuesday\, September 15\, 2026\, power system conditions allowing\, ISO New England will update the EMS/Market power system model.\n\nThe update is scheduled to start at approximately 13:20 and last until approximately 15:45.\n\nParticipants can expect a loss of 5-minute Real Time LMP and RCP postings to the ISO's website\, and stale DDP signals to their Electronic Dispatch RTUs during this time period.\n\nUpdated DDPs will resume upon completion of the EMS outage at approximately 15:45.\n\nExternal market applications will remain open during the outage\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165266
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165266
END:VEVENT
