DTSTAMP:20260925T112655Z
DTSTART:20260922T170000Z
SUMMARY:October 2026 FTR Auction Results Available
DESCRIPTION:The October 2026 Financial Transmission Rights (FTR) Auction results are now available to registered FTR Bidders via their access to the eFTR application\, and the publicly available Locational Clearing Price information and FTR Award information are available at the link below.\n\n \n\nFTR Results\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165430
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165430
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165431@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260925T112655Z
DTSTART:20260922T171900Z
SUMMARY:November 2026 FTR Bidding Window to Open
DESCRIPTION:The bidding window for the November 2026 FTR Prompt Auction and Balance of Planning Period will open on October 06\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on October 08\, 2026 (11:00 AM). The November 2026 FTR Auction results will be posted by October 19\, 2026. Registered FTR customers will find assumptions and related information for this auction posted on the FTR Assumptions page available by link from eFTR. For additional information\, please see the eFTR User Guide and ISO New England Manual for Financial Transmission Rights\, M-06\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165431
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165431
END:VEVENT
